# Revalidate by API

Instead of time‑based revalidation, you can trigger regeneration **programmatically** via an API route.

```jsx
// pages/api/revalidate.js
export default async function handler(req, res) {
  await res.revalidate('/posts');
  return res.json({ revalidated: true });
}
```

Perfect for headless CMS webhooks: when content changes, just call this endpoint.

